      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MEMORIES (2) hit the ground running from out wide last start and crossed down to lead throughout (25.76) at Shepparton in a Grade 5 over 450m. Can make it two on the bounce. DANCE LADY DANCE (1) showed strong early pace from the wide draw and stuck on well despite missing the frame, finishing fourth over 450m this track in 25.90. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Leading chance. ALACRITY DAVE (4) boxed on well to finish third last time, beaten 1.4 lengths (25.82) behind Mandolin Storm at this track. The form from his last run stacks up well. Expected to be in the finish again. RAVEN XANDER (8) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
